                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "2024 年科技创新大会在北京成功举办，多位行业领袖发表演讲",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 22,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "DJACS",
                  "name": "发布信息",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": 40,
                  "gap": 12,
                  "alignItems": "center",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "xthFp",
                      "name": "发布日期",
                      "fill": "#999999",
                      "content": "2024-03-20 14:30",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "oE8tb",
                      "name": "来源",
                      "fill": "#999999",
                      "content": "科技日报",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "bipva",
                  "name": "正文段落 1",
                  "fill": "#333333",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "【北京讯】2024 年科技创新大会于今日在北京国家会议中心隆重开幕。本次大会以创新驱动发展，科技引领未来为主题，吸引了来自全球 30 多个国家和地区的 500 余位科技界领袖、企业家和专家学者参会。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "cmKXa",
                  "name": "正文段落 2",
                  "fill": "#333333",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "大会开幕式上，多位行业领袖发表了主旨演讲。他们围绕人工智能、量子计算、生物技术、新能源等前沿领域，分享了最新的科研成果和产业应用案例。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "JDtat",
                  "name": "文中图片",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": 200,
                  "fill": "#E0E0E0",
                  "cornerRadius": 8
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "UaZ69",
                  "name": "正文段落 3",
                  "fill": "#333333",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "与会专家指出，当前全球科技创新正呈现出跨界融合、加速迭代的显著特征。科技创新不仅是推动经济增长的核心动力，更是解决人类面临的共同挑战的关键所在。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "bEZSz",
                  "name": "正文段落 4",
                  "fill": "#333333",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "在圆桌论坛环节，与会嘉宾就科技创新与产业升级、人才培养与国际合作、科技伦理与社会责任等议题展开了深入讨论。大家一致认为，加强国际合作、优化创新生态、完善政策支持体系，是推动科技创新可持续发展的关键。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "GxqRm",
                  "name": "小标题",
                  "fill": "#1A1A1A",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "重点成果展示",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "wCqtw",
                  "name": "正文段落 5",
                  "fill": "#333333",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "本次大会还设置了多个专题论坛和展览展示环节，集中展示了我国在人工智能、5G 通信、航空航天、生物医药等领域取得的一系列重大科技成果。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
